# Backlight class symlink layer only. File contents live under
# /sys/devices/... and are labeled by the DT parent genfscon
# (sysfs_leds, hal already has rw there) — no custom type needed.
# The app runs as enforcing system_app with an explicit rw grant
# (pixelparts.te) and reads through labels like everyone else.
# If dmesg ever shows a denial on these nodes, the missing piece
# will name itself — add back surgically, do not blanket-restore.
genfscon sysfs /class/backlight u:object_r:sysfs_leds:s0
